    "display_name": "Defeat the Boss",
    "bubble_choice_description": "The loop keeps running and spawning enemies even when the boss is defeated!",
    "long_instructions": "#Debug a Game Loop\r\n\r\nYou're a Game Engineer reviewing AI-generated code for a boss fight. The AI wrote the loop that controls the battle. Run it and find the bug before shipping. \r\n\r\n**What’s supposed to happen:** The boss starts with 100 HP (Health Points). Each round, an enemy spawns and attacks the player while the player is sending fireballs at the boss. The fireballs lower the boss’s HP. When the boss’s HP reaches 0 or below, the boss is defeated, the loop stops, and the game shows the result.\r\n\r\n**Your job:** Run the code and use the Debugging Checklist to find what is missing. Then fix the loop so it checks the boss’s HP each round and stops when the boss is defeated."
  },
